{"id":"tendencia","lemma":"tendencia","pos":"noun","rank":4658,"glosses":["tendency","trend, fad"],"ipa":"/tenˈdenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tendencias"},"order":4658,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tendencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él tiene tendencia a mentir.","en":"He tends to lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527458","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"to lie"}]},{"text":"Debe usted luchar contra esa tendencia que tiene.","en":"You've got to fight that tendency of yours.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to fight"},{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"}]},{"text":"Me parece a mí que ella tiene una tendencia a exagerar.","en":"It seems to me that she has a tendency to exaggerate.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538229","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"to exaggerate"}]}]}